 text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Grupo Muscular</label><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button type="button" class="min-h-[40px] px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold rounded-xl transition-all bg-[#00FF87] text-black shadow-sm font-black">Pecho</button><button type="button" class="min-h-[40px] px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold rounded-xl transition-all bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white border border-white/5">Espalda</button><button type="button" class="min-h-[40px] px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold rounded-xl transition-all bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white border border-white/5">Pierna</button><button type="button" class="min-h-[40px] px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold rounded-xl transition-all bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white border border-white/5">Hombro</button><button type="button" class="min-h-[40px] px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold rounded-xl transition-all bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white border border-white/5">Brazos</button><button type="button" class="min-h-[40px] px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold rounded-xl transition-all bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white border border-white/5">Core</button><button type="button" class="min-h-[40px] px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold rounded-xl transition-all bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white border border-white/5">Otro</button></div></div><div><label class="block text-xs font-extrabold text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5 flex items-center justify-between"><span>URL de Imagen (Preview)</span><span class="text-[10px] font-normal text-zinc-500">Miniatura visual</span></label><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-900 shrink-0 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center relative shadow-inner"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-image w-5 h-5 text-zinc-600" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"></circle><path d="m21 15-3.086-3.086a2 2 0 0 0-2.828 0L6 21"></path></svg></div><div class="flex-1"><input type="url" placeholder="https://ejemplo.com/imagen.jpg..." class="w-full min-h-[48px] px-4 text-xs rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-900 text-white placeholder:text-zinc-600 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#00FF87]" value=""/></div></div></div><div><label class="block text-xs font-extrabold text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">URL de Video</label><input type="url" placeholder="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=..." class="w-full min-h-[48px] px-4 text-xs rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-900 text-white placeholder:text-zinc-600 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#00FF87]" value=""/></div><div><label class="block text-xs font-extrabold text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Notas de Técnica (opcional)</label><textarea rows="2" placeholder="Instrucciones sobre postura, agarre o tempo..." class="w-full p-3 text-xs rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-900 text-white placeholder:text-zinc-600 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#00FF87]"></textarea></div><div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900 border border-white/[0.08]"><span class="block text-xs font-extrabold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Valores Por Defecto</span><div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3"><div><label class="block text-[10px] font-bold text-zinc-400 mb-1">Nº Series</label><input type="number" inputMode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]*" min="1" max="12" class="w-full min-h-[44px] text-center text-xs font-black rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-800 text-white focus:border-[#00FF87] focus:outline-none" value="3"/></div><div><label class="block text-[10px] font-bold text-zinc-400 mb-1">Reps / Serie</label><input type="number" inputMode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]*" min="1" max="100" class="w-full min-h-[44px] text-c